    {
      "id": "B08-23-S01",
      "path": "engine/pipeline/PL_PH_detector.py",
      "source_span": [
        770,
        784
      ],
      "interpretation": "Apply four chained global case-sensitive replacements in sequence: ph to placeholder, pl to ph, placeholder to pl, reversal target text swap; not token-aware. Replace result direction bullish; map original lows to projected highs in order. Map original highs to projected lows in order. Truthy MBL replaced with sign-copied price, else null; other MBL fields retained. Project cycle id and status. Reflect each post-PL3 Order snapshot, preserve iteration order. Recursively project each nested cycle with shared point cache. Truthy transition replaced with sign-copied level. Project transition's high through same point cache, set target bearish. Falsy transition becomes null.",
      "source_anchor": "https://github.com/suwjee/TradingBot/blob/466eb875070f02cd0dbfb105033422bbe2fd8c70/engine/pipeline/PL_PH_detector.py#L770-L784",
      "disposition": "VERIFIED",
      "verification": "LOCAL_SOURCE_CONTRACT",
      "conditional_boundary": "W2/W3 remain open."
    },
    {
      "id": "B08-23-S02",
      "path": "engine/pipeline/PL_PH_detector.py",
      "source_span": [
        785,
        799
      ],
      "interpretation": "Native request kind PL only when reflected core asks PH, else PH. Call original Orders with native kind and unchanged number/gate/event; reflect each returned snapshot in order. Read original confirm_high attribute with null fallback on each callback. Invoke only non-null callback; no truthiness or callable validation. Pass native projected point; ignore callback return. Run bearish core with reflected chronology, unchanged native S/E/StopAll, then project result. Create new adapter instance and pass same run object in reflected coordinates.",
      "source_anchor": "https://github.com/suwjee/TradingBot/blob/466eb875070f02cd0dbfb105033422bbe2fd8c70/engine/pipeline/PL_PH_detector.py#L785-L799",
      "disposition": "VERIFIED",
      "verification": "LOCAL_SOURCE_CONTRACT",
      "conditional_boundary": "W2/W3 remain open."
    }
